 12++ 6140              ;   00 seconds, 02 minutes, 04 hours, 0A Status A, 0B Status B, 0D Status D
 13++ 6140              ; Status B bit 2: 1=binary, 0=BCD; bit 1: 1=24-hour, 0=12-hour.
 14++ 6140              ; Status A bit 7: UIP. Status D bit 7: VRT (valid RAM/time).
